\"beds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Max. Beds</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Location</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">City</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Carlin</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"street\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Street</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Senja Street</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Features</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"floors\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Floors</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rooms\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Rooms</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.5<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 19, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Buildings <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-house-furnishings\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Furnishings\">Furnishings</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This house has no furnishings.</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-house-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<div class=\"map_image\" style=\"width:150px;display:inline-block;position: relative;\"><img alt=\"75?cb=20260713145837&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\"/>\n<div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div>\n<div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div>\n</div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\">\n<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32187,31633,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32187, 31633, 7)</a></div>\n<p>Northeast Senja\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-house-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<dl><dd></dd></dl>\n<p>Senja Castle is located on the north-east side  of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Islands\">Ice Islands</a> of <a href=\"#/wiki/Senja\">Senja</a>. It was once inhabited by Alawar, a perhaps evil <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">sorcerer</a>.<br/>\nAlawar has his <a href=\"#/quest/alawars-vault-quest\">treasure</a> locked away beneath the castle. It is guarded two ways: by mercenary <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaurs\">Minotaurs</a> from below, and a room of <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Field\">fire</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Field\">poison</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Field\">energy fields</a> from above.<br/>\nOnce in the treasure room, the teleports there take you to the roof of Senja Castle. There is a room below the room with <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Field\">fire</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Field\">poison</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Field\">energy fields</a> that contains two chests, which can be opened for a prize.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Senja_Street_Buildings\">Related Senja Street Buildings</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Senja Clanhall</li><li>Senja Village 10</li><li>Senja Village 11</li><li>Senja Village 1a</li><li>Senja Village 1b</li><li>Senja Village 3</li><li>Senja Village 4</li><li>Senja Village 5</li><li>Senja Village 6a</li><li>Senja Village 6b</li><li>Senja Village 7</li><li>Senja Village 8</li><li>Senja Village 9</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["alawars-vault-quest"]}